e C understands complicated technology.\" That addresses technical competence. So we can strengthen C's case further.\n\nBut we also need to discuss other candidates. Perhaps we can bring up Candidate B's strengths: very conscientious, handles stress well, good at assessing weather, excellent computer skills. But also concerns: makes nasty remarks, weak memory for numbers. We can compare B's stress handling vs C's. But we need to decide if we still support C or shift.\n\nGiven the evidence, C seems still strongest. We can support C, adding more evidence: C keeps calm in crisis, understands complicated technology, which covers stress resilience and technical competence. Also note that C's communication difficulty is mitigated by positive crew atmosphere. So we can reaffirm vote for C.\n\nThus public message: agree with previous, add new facts: C keeps calm in crisis, understands complicated technology, which addresses stress resilience and technical competence. Also note that B's stress handling is good but his attitude is problematic. So C remains best.\n\nMetadata vote: Candidate C.\n\nProceed."}
